{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, move, grab, check properties, do specific task. Else, scan area, move to next point. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextPoint    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
